# Haunted Audit Dashboard

## Project

Haunted Audit dashboard: Vite + React + TypeScript + React Router in `/dashboard`.

## Scope

- Touch **ONLY** `/dashboard`.
- Do not change the backend, the bank page, or any API contract.
- If something needs a backend change, stop and tell the user.

## Data

- Real data only. No fake numbers, no invented results.
- Show `--` until measured.
- Show a clear "backend offline" state when the API is down.

## Accessibility

- 16px text, visible focus, 200% zoom, AA contrast, reduced motion
- One H1 per page, semantic HTML, no colour-only status

## Decorative art

- All decorative art is inline SVG, `aria-hidden`, `pointer-events: none`, behind interactive content.

## Workflow

- Work in stages. After each stage, stop, list the files changed and how to test, and wait.

## Dependencies

- No new dependencies without asking, except ones named in the prompt.
